# Fixture affix file for spell_kit tests: COMPOUNDRULE and COMPOUNDMIN, at a fixture scale of the
# mechanism en_GB's real dictionary uses for ordinal numbers (21st, 1234th).
SET UTF-8
TRY adnorstuw

COMPOUNDMIN 2
ONLYINCOMPOUND Z

# Pattern: zero or more pieces flagged n, then one piece flagged o, then one piece flagged t.
COMPOUNDRULE 1
COMPOUNDRULE n*ot
